  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.0.0 (breaking). The contracts move to two namespaces: CQRSharp (requests, handlers, results, notifications, contexts) and CQRSharp.Persistence (store and unit-of-work contracts).\n            CommandResult gains a typed ErrorKind, kind factories and validation failures as data; CommandResult<T> gains a public constructor. Handler interfaces take no context type argument.\n            IUnitOfWork is the one unit-of-work contract. IOutboxStore is claim-based and gains dead-letter and backlog operations, IInboxStore is new, and IIdempotencyStore claims carry a token and a payload fingerprint and store the result for replay.\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.0.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes and the upgrade steps from 4.2.1.",
